POST /auth/register (Updated)
Endpoint: `POST /auth/register`
New Required Field for TUTOR role:
{  // ... existing fields  role: 'PARENT' | 'TUTOR',  // Tutor application fields (required when role=TUTOR)  expectedMonthlySalaryNGN: number, // NEW - min 10000, max 5000000  // ... other tutor fields}
Validation:
- `expectedMonthlySalaryNGN` must be integer between 10000 and 5000000
- Required when role=TUTOR
- Not required for PARENT
Implementation:
- Add salary input field to tutor registration form
- Validate: minimum 10000, maximum 5000000
- Show currency symbol (₦) and formatting
- Only show this field when role=TUTOR is selected
7. General Notes
Rate Limiting
- Login rate limits now include portal in the key
- Admin portal: 5 requests per 15 minutes
- Parent/Tutor portals: 7 requests per 15 minutes
- Implement appropriate error messages for rate limit exceeded
Security
- Portal mismatch returns same error as wrong password (no role leak)
- Salary is read-only for tutors (only admins can change)
- Tutors don't see parent contact details or prices in schedule responses
- Admins don't see studentCode in enrollment responses
Error Handling
- Handle 401 for invalid credentials (including portal mismatch)
- Handle 403 for account status issues
- Handle 400 for validation errors
- Handle 404 for not found resources
- Handle 429 for rate limit exceeded
Data Refreshing
- Badge counts should be refreshed periodically or on relevant actions
- Consider using React Query or similar for caching and refetching
- Invalidate badge counts when notifications are read, messages are sent, etc.
